---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base title="Resources - Slovak Brain Drain" lang="en">
  <h1>Resources and Counter-currents</h1>
  <p>The data shows real loss, but the picture is not uniformly grim. These are the people and institutions working against the drain.</p>

  <section class="resources-content">
    <h2>Diaspora maps and networks</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><a href="https://slovaks.ai" target="_blank">slovaks.ai</a> - Curated database of 90+ Slovak AI professionals working abroad, maintained by KInIT.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Slovak tech built at home</h2>
    <p>ESET, Sygic, Innovatrics, Pixel Federation, Vacuumlabs, Slido (Cisco). These companies chose to build from Bratislava, proving world-class tech does not require emigration.</p>

    <h2>Return cases</h2>
    <p>Jan Tkac returned from Sweden with an ERC Starting Grant in 2014, bringing 1.5M EUR to the Slovak Academy of Sciences. Exceptional, but proof that return is possible with the right institutional support.</p>

    <h2>What you can do</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Nominate a researcher for the <a href="https://www.esetscienceaward.sk" target="_blank">ESET Science Award</a></li>
      <li>Suggest an addition to <a href="https://slovaks.ai" target="_blank">slovaks.ai</a></li>
      <li>The data on this site is CC-BY 4.0. Use it.</li>
    </ul>
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
  .resources-content { max-width: 680px; }
  .resources-content h2 { font-family: var(--font-heading); margin-top: 2rem; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; font-size: 1.2rem; }
  .resources-content ul { padding-left: 1.25rem; margin-bottom: 1rem; }
  .resources-content li { margin-bottom: 0.5rem; font-size: 0.95rem; }
  .resources-content a { color: var(--color-accent, #c44d2b); }
</style>
